   "title": "Suspected connective tissue disease (CTD): which lab test, and when NOT to order it?",
   "lines": [
    "no blood test diagnoses a CTD alone: clinical features are needed too",
    "about 1 in 3 women are ANA positive; lupus (SLE) is 1 in 1,000"
   ]
  },
